{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see object, move and take it, check properties, do specific task, store it, and release it. Otherwise, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesCheck    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
